rual cycles.", "SÍNTOMAS DEPRESIVOS:Síntomas depresivos refers to depressive symptoms that may occur in patients taking fentermina and topiramato.)<|COMPLETE|>", "XENDOS:XENDOS is a randomized double-blind study involving 3,305 non-diabetic obese patients, aimed at evaluating the effectiveness of the weight loss drug Xenical in preventing diabetes. The study specifically focuses on the prevention of diabetes among obese individuals through the administration of this medication.", "CONTRAVE:Contrave is a combination medication of bupropion and naltrexone approved in the USA for weight management.", "MYSIMBA:Mysimba is the European name for the combination of bupropion and naltrexone used for weight management."], "parameters": {"model": "text-embedding-3-small", "temperature": 0.0, "frequency_penalty": null, "presence_penalty": null, "top_p": 1.0, "max_tokens": 4000, "n": 1}, "history": null}